    J -->|예| K[MCP: export_trusted_mappings<br/>또는 deferred case 선택]
    K --> L[IDA Pro MCP 연결]
    L --> M[IDA: 함수 주소 열기]
    M --> N[IDA: decompile]
    N --> O[로직 분석<br/>문자열 상수 caller callee 확인]
    O --> P{의미가 확인됐는가}

    P -->|예| Q[IDA: rename]
    Q --> R[MCP: batch_register_force_anchors]
    R --> S[MCP: patch_features_with_confirmed]
    S --> T[MCP: targeted_retrieval]
    T --> U[MCP: select_seed_anchors<br/>targeted_high_confidence 포함]
    U --> V[MCP: run_downstream]
    V --> W{새 accepted 증가?}
    W -->|예| H
    W -->|아니오| X[수렴 종료]

    P -->|아니오| Y[deferred 유지 또는 blacklist 검토]
    Y --> Z[MCP: update_noise_blacklist]
    Z --> V

    J -->|아니오| X